title Cassette state (PLAY/PAUSE key, hubs, meter): a take playing: PLAY latched, both hubs counterclockwise (150 degrees a second), the played level on L and R
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO playing
env CASSETTE_ANIM_TICKS 2
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot state-playing
expect text "PLAY"
expect notext "PAUSE"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
